---
import core from '../../../lib/relational-collection/core.json';
import history from './downloads/history.json';
const initial=core.products.find(p=>p.product_id==='P7').price;
const rows=[[initial,initial],[initial,history.first_price],[initial,history.corrected_price]];
---
<figure data-two-times data-grid={JSON.stringify(rows)} class="two-times" aria-labelledby="r04-times-title">
<figcaption id="r04-times-title"><span>Figure 1</span> Hold one time still; change the other</figcaption>
<div class="questions"><label>Effective at <select data-effective><option value="0">20 Oct 10:15 · order 103</option><option value="1" selected>21 Oct 12:00 · after change</option></select></label><label>Using records known at <select data-known><option value="0">20 Oct 10:15 · baseline</option><option value="1" selected>21 Oct 12:00 · before correction</option><option value="2">22 Oct 15:00 · after correction</option></select></label></div>
<div class="history-grid" aria-label="Catalogue price answers by effective time and recorded knowledge">
<div class="axis">Recorded knowledge ↓<br/>Effective time →</div><strong>Before 21 Oct 09:00</strong><strong>From 21 Oct 09:00</strong>
{rows.map((row,r)=><><div class="row-name">{['20 Oct baseline','21 Oct · price change known','22 Oct · correction known'][r]}</div>{row.map((price,c)=><div class="price-cell" data-r={r} data-c={c}>{price}<span data-selection data-live></span></div>)}</>)}
</div>
<p class="answer" data-answer data-live aria-live="polite">At 21 Oct 12:00, using what was known then, P7’s catalogue price is 25.00.</p>
<p class="agreement">Order 103’s agreed mug price: <strong>{initial}</strong>, in every view.</p>
<p class="caption">All times are UTC in 2026. Each cell is a query answer, not one physical stored row. The baseline starts the example’s recorded history at order 103’s instant; it makes no claim about earlier recording. Before a change is recorded, this model’s open-ended assertion continues the last known price.</p>
</figure>
<script>
document.querySelectorAll('[data-two-times]').forEach(root=>{
const grid=JSON.parse(root.getAttribute('data-grid'));const effective=root.querySelector('[data-effective]');const known=root.querySelector('[data-known]');
const draw=()=>{const r=Number(known.value),c=Number(effective.value);root.querySelectorAll('.price-cell').forEach(el=>{const selected=Number(el.getAttribute('data-r'))===r&&Number(el.getAttribute('data-c'))===c;el.classList.toggle('selected',selected);el.querySelector('[data-selection]').textContent=selected?'Selected answer':'';});root.querySelector('[data-answer]').textContent=`For ${c===0?'order 103’s instant, 20 Oct 10:15':'21 Oct 12:00 after the effective change'}, using ${['the baseline record','the record before correction','the record after correction'][r]}, the catalogue price is ${grid[r][c]}.`;};effective.addEventListener('change',draw);known.addEventListener('change',draw);draw();
});
</script>
<style>
.two-times{margin:2rem 0;font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.2rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.8rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;margin-right:.7rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.questions{display:grid;gap:.75rem;padding:1rem;background:var(--color-surface-alt)}label{display:grid;gap:.35rem}select{font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);background:var(--color-surface);color:var(--color-text);padding:.5rem;max-width:100%;width:100%}select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:3px}.history-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr;border-left:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong)}.history-grid>div,.history-grid>strong{padding:.75rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);border-right:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);min-width:0}.history-grid>strong{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:500}.axis,.row-name{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.price-cell{font:1.5rem var(--font-serif);display:grid;align-content:center;gap:.35rem}.price-cell span{font:.72rem var(--font-sans);min-height:1.6rem}.selected{outline:2px solid var(--color-accent);outline-offset:-3px;background:var(--color-surface-alt)}.answer{border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding:1rem;margin:0}.agreement{padding:.75rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong);margin:.5rem 0}.caption{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:500px){.history-grid{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr 1fr}.history-grid>div,.history-grid>strong{padding:.6rem .45rem}.price-cell{font-size:1.3rem}}
</style>
